3. Example models  --  examples/*/model.osim
   The models are scaled or adapted copies of published OpenSim models:
   - examples/markerless-theia and examples/markers-cycling: the
     RajagopalLaiUhlrich2023 model, which derives from the Rajagopal et al.
     (2016) full-body model (https://simtk.org/projects/full_body) with the
     Lai et al. (2017) and Uhlrich et al. (2022) modifications.
   - examples/imu-orientations: the Catelli et al. (2019) high hip flexion
     model (https://simtk.org/projects/high-hip-flex), itself built on the
     Rajagopal et al. (2016) and Lai et al. (2017) models.

